(FIL-09: the File Properties worked example (open for reading, print size, print modified, compare size against 1048576) compiles and behaves as the surrounding prose says.
 Run from the vox-fuzz worktree root; the probe creates everything it
 needs under vf_scratch/files/ and touches nothing else.
 Extended 2026-10-05 (files batch C): appended two rendered shapes of
 'gen leaf file properties worked example' - size asserted, modified
 range-checked, and the size guard against a drawn threshold that fires
 in one and not the other.
 Ran (vox 0.4.15, 2026-10-05): VOX_CORE_PATH=/usr/share/vox/coreasm /usr/bin/vox docs/ledger/probes/files/FIL-09.vox -o p && ./p
 exit code 0; actual output:
   16
   modified is a plausible unix timestamp
   the size comparison did not fire
   277
   FIL-09 in range
